---
// AnnouncementBar.astro - Banner estrecho superior para captar avatar B2B al instante
---

<div class="bg-andes-primary text-white text-xs sm:text-[13px] py-2 px-4 font-medium sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-xs">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse shrink-0"></span>
      <span class="font-bold tracking-wide uppercase text-[10px] sm:text-xs bg-white/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded shrink-0">
        Cupos Q4
      </span>
      <span class="truncate">
        Solo 2 plazas disponibles este mes para proyectos de software y plataformas a medida.
      </span>
    </div>
    <a 
      href="#formulario-calificacion" 
      class="underline hover:text-white/80 shrink-0 font-semibold transition-opacity hidden sm:inline"
    >
      Verificar disponibilidad &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
